                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Nice little game! You control your movement with only one button (trigger on Vive) that lets you walk forward to the next lane / pedestrian walkway. You can look around and judge the speed of incoming traffic but once you're on the road there is no turning back! On big roads with multiple lanes this can be really adrenalin pumping! Fortunately the trigger does not only let you walk to the next lane but also allows you to start running (when holding it pressed), so you accellerate and cross the lanes faster. Really a fun game!",
